flowchart TB
    subgraph ClientLayer ["Client & Interface Layer"]
        MobileApp["Mobile Banking App / Client"]
        SwaggerUI["Swagger OpenAPI 3 UI"]
        Postman["Postman / API Clients"]
    end

    subgraph SecurityLayer ["Security & Ingestion Layer"]
        Tomcat["Apache Tomcat Port 8080"]
        SecurityFilter["JwtAuthenticationFilter"]
        SecurityConfig["Spring Security FilterChain"]
    end

    subgraph ControllerLayer ["REST Controller Layer"]
        AuthController["AuthController"]
        UserController["UserController"]
        AccountController["BankAccountController"]
        UpiController["UpiIdController"]
        TxnController["TransactionController"]
        PaymentReqController["PaymentRequestController"]
    end

    subgraph ServiceLayer ["Domain & Business Service Layer"]
        UserService["UserServiceImpl"]
        AccountService["BankAccountServiceImpl"]
        UpiService["UpiIdServiceImpl"]
        TxnService["TransactionServiceImpl"]
        PaymentReqService["PaymentRequestServiceImpl"]
        PinService["UpiPinServiceImpl"]
        OutboxService["OutboxServiceImpl"]
        LockService["DistributedLockServiceImpl"]
        OtpService["OtpCacheServiceImpl"]
    end

    subgraph DataLayer ["Persistence & Caching Layer"]
        PostgresDB[("PostgreSQL 15 Database\n(Users, Accounts, VPAs, Ledger)")]
        RedisCache[("Redis 7 In-Memory Cache\n(Locks, OTPs, Rate Limits)")]
    end

    subgraph EventLayer ["Asynchronous Event Streaming Layer"]
        OutboxScheduler["OutboxScheduler (@Scheduled)"]
        OutboxPublisher["OutboxPublisherServiceImpl"]
        KafkaBroker["Apache Kafka Broker\n(KRaft Mode)"]
        KafkaConsumers["Transaction & Payment Consumers"]
        DLTTopic["Dead Letter Topics (.DLT)"]
        ReplayService["ReplayServiceImpl"]
    end

    MobileApp & SwaggerUI & Postman -->|HTTP POST/GET| Tomcat
    Tomcat --> SecurityFilter
    SecurityFilter --> SecurityConfig
    SecurityConfig --> ControllerLayer

    ControllerLayer --> ServiceLayer
    ServiceLayer -->|BCrypt Matching| PinService
    ServiceLayer -->|Redisson Locks / OTP| RedisCache
    ServiceLayer -->|JPA Repositories| PostgresDB
    ServiceLayer -->|In-Transaction Outbox| OutboxService

    OutboxService -->|Write PENDING Event| PostgresDB
    OutboxScheduler -->|Poll PENDING Events| PostgresDB
    OutboxScheduler --> OutboxPublisher
    OutboxPublisher -->|Publish JSON Record| KafkaBroker

    KafkaBroker --> KafkaConsumers
    KafkaConsumers -->|Write Processed EventId| PostgresDB
    KafkaConsumers -.->|Failure & Retries Exhausted| DLTTopic
    DLTTopic --> ReplayService
    ReplayService -.->|Re-publish Record| KafkaBroker
